[REQUIREMENT]
UID: AC-SRS012
TITLE: Read back the sequence number
STATEMENT: >>>
A sequence instruction shall be read back as Number and the spoken digits, including the runway when the instruction names one, and then the call sign. The sequence shall be stored and shall not change phase, position, or speed. Acceptance is Number two, runway two seven, followed by the call sign, with the maneuver unchanged.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Sequence is information. It is not a clearance to move.
<<<
DAL: E
